# What this suite is written in. The program says 正體 when nobody has said otherwise (host/i18n.ts), and nearly every
# assertion here quotes a sentence word for word — in 简体, because that is the language the program was written in and
# i18n/zh-CN.ts is still its key set. So the suite says so, once, here: `npm test` hands this to Node with --env-file,
# every child process inherits it, and tests/i18n.test.ts is the one file that puts it back to see 正體.
#
# The shell wins over this file (that is what --env-file does), so `AGENT_AUTOLOOP_LANG=zh-TW npm test` still works.
AGENT_AUTOLOOP_LANG=zh-CN
